{"namespace":"test-clusters","name":"no-secrets-cluster","format":"yaml","includeSecrets":false,"backup":"# Cluster Backup\n# Cluster: test-clusters/no-secrets-cluster\n# Date: <TIMESTAMP>\n# Resources included:\n# - Cluster\n# - Control Plane\n# - MachineDeployments\n# - Infrastructure Resources\n---\n# This is a placeholder implementation\n# Use velero or similar tools for complete cluster backup\n# Example: velero backup create cluster-backup --include-namespaces=\u003cnamespace\u003e\n","suggestedFilename":"cluster-test-clusters-no-secrets-cluster-backup.yaml","notes":["The backup covers CAPI resources only; workload data is not included","Infrastructure provider resources may need a separate backup","Store the backup in a secure location and test the restore procedure outside production"]}